@ref 8 Del. C. § 253(a) (src:1137)
GIVEN direction                                                                IS A `s 253(a) Direction of the merger`
      `the parent corporation is a corporation of this State`                  IS A BOOLEAN
      certificate                                                              IS A `s 253(a) Certificate of ownership and merger`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 253(a) the certificate of ownership and merger states what the subsection requires` direction `the parent corporation is a corporation of this State` certificate MEANS
        certificate's `executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with s 103`
    AND certificate's `sets forth a copy of the resolution of the board of directors of the parent corporation to merge`
