    THEN `the vote carries` (`a majority of` `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`) `the number of votes cast in favor of the merger by the parent corporation's stockholders` `the number of votes of the outstanding stock of the parent corporation entitled to vote`
    ELSE NOTHING

