    CONSIDER direction
    WHEN `the parent corporation merges the subsidiary corporation or corporations into itself and assumes all of its or their obligations`
         THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the parent corporation merges itself, or itself and one or more of the other subsidiary corporations, into one of the subsidiary corporations`
         THEN TRUE

-- src:1141 | Section § 251(d) of this title shall apply to a merger under this section, and § 251(e) of this title shall apply to a merger under this section in which the surviving corporation is the subsidiary corporation and is a corporation of this State. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 253(c) (src:1141)
GIVEN direction                                                           IS A `s 253(a) Direction of the merger`
      `the surviving corporation is a corporation of this State`          IS A BOOLEAN
