`s 253(c) s 251(e) applies to the merger` direction `the surviving corporation is a corporation of this State` MEANS
    CONSIDER direction
    WHEN `the parent corporation merges the subsidiary corporation or corporations into itself and assumes all of its or their obligations`
         THEN FALSE
    WHEN `the parent corporation merges itself, or itself and one or more of the other subsidiary corporations, into one of the subsidiary corporations`
         THEN `the surviving corporation is a corporation of this State`

